OL,3,AAnthropic safety researcher says more
OL,4,Athan 10% chance AI 'could kill all
OL,5,Ahumans'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA top safety researcher at Anthropic's
OL,8,Fhas warned AI is advancing so quickly
OL,9,Fthere is a greater than 10% chance it
OL,10,F"could kill all humans" within the next
OL,11,Fdecade.
OL,13,FEvan Hubinger said in a post on X the
OL,14,Frisk from the models which currently
OL,15,Fexist is "low", but he was "worried"
OL,16,Fthe technology may become able to
OL,17,Fimprove itself to reach this point.
OL,19,FIt comes after the Financial Times
OL,20,Freported Anthropic withheld its latest
OL,21,Fmodel from the AI Safety Institute,
OL,22,Fwhich tests AI.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
